{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9TaGVybG9jayUyMEhvbG1lcyUyMEFuZCUyMFRoZSUyMEdyZWF0JTIwRXNjYXBlJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Sherlock Holmes And The Great Escape","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ZmF6DLxmgc7gZ3Ryqmdix6RKN9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AiGaTdlTL6i6nH5nEQSdjEKA8pM.jpg","description":"In the late 19th century, Mack, a heroic outlaw who stole from the rich to give to the poor, was loved and respected by the people, but he had long been a difficult case for the Yard. With the help of Sherlock, detective Gordon Gorilla Riller and Carlson Fox finally managed to catch Mack at his daughter Katie's birthday party. But Sherlock was then reviled by the people for arresting their hero. Four years later, Mack fights with the notorious Scarface in prison, and then climbs over the wall to escape. While tracking down Mack, Sherlock discovers Mack's heart-breaking reason behind his escape, and decides to let him fulfill his final wish before he would voluntarily surrender to the police. However, Scarface suddenly appears and kidnaps Katie. Sherlock and Watson team up with Gordon Gorilla Riller and Carlson Fox for the rescue. A battle between life and death is unfolding.\n\nRated PG · Released 1 Aug 2019 · Hong Kong · Language: Chinese · 84 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Chinese","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Animation","Adventure","Mystery","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"84 min","cast":["Ken Kai-Cheong Wong","Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung","Pasu Wai-Tak Leung","Monte Kai-Him Cho","Toe Yuen","Stephen Au","Vivien Wai-Wan Lau","Jerry Koo Ming-wah"],"director":["Toe Yuen","Matthew Chow Wing-siu"],"released":"2019-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Toe Yuen","character":"Director"},{"name":"Ken Kai-Cheong Wong","character":"Sherlock Holmes (voice)"},{"name":"Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung","character":"Gordon Riller","photo":"https://image.tmd